# The NIGHT daypart is a midnight-crossing BAND in colloquial clock usage,
# not a uniform +12 PM shift: small hours 1..5 stay AM, evening hours 6..11
# are PM, twelve is midnight (the band-split lives in the resolver
# _clock_hms via night_meridiems; see chronologia/locale/es/
# clock_meridiem_night.voc for the shared Romance mechanism).
# Surfaces + their a-initial twins per native-speaker review, source:
# https://github.com/OpenVoiceOS/ovos-date-parser/issues/300
nuèch
nuèit
nèit
nèt
nèch
nuòch
anuèch
anuèit
anèit
anèt
anèch
anuòch
